Let the given expression be $E$. We have 
$$E = \sqrt{\dfrac{\dfrac4{\sqrt{24}}+\dfrac{\sqrt{3456}}9+\sqrt{6}}{\sqrt6}}$$
First, we simplify $\sqrt{24} = \sqrt{4 \cdot 6} = 2\sqrt{6}$.
So, $\dfrac4{\sqrt{24}} = \dfrac4{2\sqrt{6}} = \dfrac2{\sqrt{6}}$.
Next, we simplify $\sqrt{3456} = \sqrt{576 \cdot 6} = \sqrt{24^2 \cdot 6} = 24\sqrt{6}$.
Then, $\dfrac{\sqrt{3456}}{9} = \dfrac{24\sqrt{6}}{9} = \dfrac{8\sqrt{6}}{3}$.
Thus,
$$\dfrac{\dfrac4{\sqrt{24}}+\dfrac{\sqrt{3456}}9+\sqrt{6}}{\sqrt6} = \dfrac{\dfrac2{\sqrt{6}} + \dfrac{8\sqrt{6}}{3} + \sqrt{6}}{\sqrt{6}} = \dfrac{\dfrac2{\sqrt{6}} + \dfrac{8\sqrt{6}}{3} + \dfrac{3\sqrt{6}}{3}}{\sqrt{6}} = \dfrac{\dfrac{6 + 8\sqrt{6} + 3\sqrt{6}}{3\sqrt{6}}}{\sqrt{6}} = \dfrac{\dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{3\sqrt{6}}}{\sqrt{6}} = \dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{3\sqrt{6} \cdot \sqrt{6}} = \dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{3(6)} = \dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{18}$$
Now,
$$E = \sqrt{\dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{18}} = \sqrt{\dfrac{6 + 11\sqrt{6}}{18}}$$

Alternatively
